Objective

1. To understand the concept of tree data structures.
2. To represent a file directory structure using a tree.
3. To create directories and subdirectories.
4. To display all subdirectories under a specified directory.
5. To understand parent-child relationships in a tree.
6. To implement tree traversal using C++.



